WEBVTT

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.566
that old lady who's been
in your living room for weeks.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.236
Who is she anyway?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.173
No squatters allowed.

00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:38.086
I don't care if you're a ghost.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.726
Also, not to brag,

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.000
but I've been micro-decluttering
since before Marie Kondo got big.

00:00:44.024 --> 00:00:45.634
In fact, I've cut out her step

00:00:45.658 --> 00:00:48.881
of picking things up and figuring out
whether they spark joy in me

00:00:48.905 --> 00:00:51.015
because I already know
what sparks joy in me,

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:52.936
throwing out trash.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.166
What kind of trash?

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:55.956
Well, I'll give you a clue.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:58.376
It starts with H and it ends with air.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.276
That's right, it's a lot of hair.